+// - a variant holding `&'a C` (`DataRef::TrueRef`) is `Send` only when `C: Sync`,
+// - `Arc<C>` is `Send`/`Sync` only when `C: Send + Sync`,
+// so every impl that can expose a shared reference (directly or through
